<workout_file>
	<author>Jarvis Chau (via TrainingPeaks)</author>
	<name>Sweet Spot (90 mins)</name>
	<description>One of TrainingPeaks Virtual&apos;s classic workouts:
Sweet Spot Training.

The perfect endurance workout; warm-up, 60 minutes just enough below your FTP to get a really good workout, but without becoming over-tired, and then you&apos;re done. Simple, but effective.</description>
	<sportType>bike</sportType>
	<tags/>
	<workout>
		<Warmup Duration="600" PowerHigh="0.73" PowerLow="0.53">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
10:Welcome to Sweet Spot;
20:This classic workout is perfect for improving your FTP.;
30:Just 60 minutes of work - 5 minutes on, 5 minutes off, six times.;
60:For now, focus on warming up, and getting your legs spinning.;
300:Half way through the warmup.;
540:1 minute to go.;
}"/>
		</Warmup>
		<SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.94">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
0:Bring the power up to just below your FTP now.;
60:First minute done.
Good job.;
240:1 minute to go.;
}"/>
		</SteadyState>
		<SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.85">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
0:Just ease off the power slightly.;
10:Keep the legs spinning.
Focus on recovery at pace.;
240:1 minute to go until we take it back up again.;
}"/>
		</SteadyState>
		<SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.94">
			<textevent timeoffset="0" message="!TextEvents:{
0:Second set.
Back to just below your FTP now.;
60:First minute done.
